    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a subject I appreciate for its logical structure and problem-solving nature. While it's not my strongest skill due to limited formal education beyond vocational training, I find joy in tackling math problems when they arise in practical situations, like cooking or photography. It’s a tool that helps me understand patterns and make precise calculations, even if I don’t delve deep into theoretical aspects.",
